[00:08.260]An empty street
{"空荡的街道"}
[00:09.960]An empty house
{"空荡的房间"}
[00:11.560]A hole inside my heart
{"心中有个空洞"}
[00:14.980]I'm all alone
{"我孤身一人"}
[00:16.730]The rooms are getting smaller
{"房间逐渐变得狭小"}
[00:21.660]I wonder how
{"我想知道如何"}
[00:23.280]I wonder why
{"我想知道为何"}
[00:24.970]I wonder where they are
{"我想知道他们在何方"}
[00:28.260]The days we had
{"我们共度的时光"}
[00:29.960]The songs we sang together
{"我们一起唱过的歌"}
[00:32.920]Oh yeah
[00:34.610]And oh, my love
{"与哦，我的爱人"}
[00:38.270]I'm holding on forever
{"我永远坚持着"}
[00:41.760]Reaching for a love that seems so far
{"试图触碰那遥不可及的爱"}
[00:47.550]So I say a little prayer
{"于是我轻声祈祷"}
[00:50.710]And hope my dreams will take me there
{"希望梦境能带我去往那里"}
[00:54.210]Where the skies are blue to see you once again, my love
{"在那碧空如洗之处再次见到你　我的爱"}
[01:00.870]Over seas from coast to coast
